        "Description": "Good evening 47,\r\rTwo delivery drivers managed to turn a simple food order into a disaster. Cold food, pathetic excuses, and zero professionalism.\r\rThe fallout was bigger than they ever expected. Multiple contract killers have already tried to eliminate the targets but every one of them failed.\r\rNow, the two have disappeared and are hiding on a remote island, convinced they&apos;re finally safe.\r\rYour job is to teach them a lesson and succeed where everyone else has failed.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
